  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此模組為《Minecraft》新增了以各種生物為靈感的不死圖騰。這些新圖騰注入了生物的生命精華，除了像普通不死圖騰一樣在玩家遭遇非自然死亡時拯救其性命外，使用時還會根據其對應的生物產生獨特的效果。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RZXtAJum0mg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2>圖騰：</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>爆炸不死圖騰</strong>：啟動時，會在玩家周圍引發爆炸。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ba2bec0c3872a9b4db5d32cf875c9475d78a42b2.png\" alt=\"爆炸不死圖騰的合成配方，圖騰周圍環繞 8 個火藥\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>骸骨不死圖騰</strong>（骷髏）：啟動時，賦予玩家一種名為「狙擊手」的藥水效果，使其投射物傷害加倍。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/651774fafd5a3f30ebe668a05a561218d361372d.png\" alt=\"骸骨不死圖騰的合成配方，圖騰周圍環繞 8 根骨頭\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>傳送不死圖騰</strong>（終界使者）：啟動時，玩家會傳送回重生點。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c9a4b06d7f0cb8f285745e3a45294d66ca4c7f3.png\" alt=\"傳送不死圖騰的合成配方，圖騰周圍環繞 4 顆末影珍珠與 4 個終界之眼\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>鬼魅不死圖騰</strong>（惡魂）：啟動時，賦予玩家漂浮、緩降與抗火藥水效果。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/09535200751aecfb16e5789ddf2dbdd805c94880.png\" alt=\"鬼魅不死圖騰的合成配方，圖騰周圍環繞 8 滴惡魂之淚\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>蜇刺不死圖騰</strong>（蜜蜂）：啟動時，圖騰會召喚 5 隻蜜蜂來保護玩家免受敵人攻擊。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a617db56afd83376fa4528a098f4df75f4879b67.png\" alt=\"蜇刺不死圖騰的合成配方，圖騰周圍環繞 8 個蜂蜜塊\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>觸手不死圖騰</strong>（魷魚）：啟動時，賦予玩家自訂藥水效果「頭足類」以及原版藥水效果「潮涌能量」。頭足類會讓任何攻擊玩家的實體陷入失明與緩慢狀態，並讓任何被玩家攻擊的實體陷入失明。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb5c477bb58390d268d5c147c2d0022c2dcdc83e.png\" alt=\"觸手不死圖騰的合成配方，圖騰周圍環繞 8 個墨囊\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>腐爛不死圖騰</strong>（殭屍）：啟動時，圖騰會召喚 3 隻友方殭屍來保護玩家免受敵人攻擊，並賦予玩家一種獨特的藥水效果「壞死」。壞死可讓玩家從受到傷害和使用毒藥瓶時恢復生命值，但使用生命值和再生藥瓶時反而會失去生命值。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6c58b06132fddff1b7e150a825f2dfadf1f83aeb.png\" alt=\"腐爛不死圖騰的合成配方，圖騰周圍環繞 8 塊腐肉\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需求：</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Fabric API</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Curios API 相容擴充套件：</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-curios-totems-of-undying\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-curios-totems-of-undying</a></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">貼圖製作： <br> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fNarynotnarold%253ft%253d2hClpsI8TWfZZpXgESL61Q%2526s%253d09\" rel=\"nofollow\">Narynotnarold</a> <br> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fEvoliRavioli%253ft%253dvf2uX3O1O8lnrFoo87xq6Q%2526s%253d09\" rel=\"nofollow\">EvoliRavioli</a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><em>試試看 Kinetic Hosting，打造省心且經濟實惠的《Minecraft》伺服器！</em></em></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d587\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVfuXg1.png\" alt=\"Cyborg Pigeon 的 Kinetic Hosting 推薦連結\"></a></p>",
